# Judge Questions

### Why Offline First?

Many deployment locations have intermittent connectivity. The system must continue operating without internet access.

### Why Policy Engine?

Authentication only identifies users. Policy determines the action to be taken.

### Why Local Storage?

Records must be retained until synchronization becomes available.

### Why Sync Queue?

Ensures no data loss during connectivity interruptions.

